l__rate-icon\"></i></div></td></tr> <tr><td class=\"h3\">攻击</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">441</td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">会心</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">22</td></tr></tbody></table> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-desc\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">如雏鸟初见朝阳，如秋风撷去芬芳；</span></p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">如幼鱼破卵而出，如前路挥别故乡。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">少女因此知晓，生命即是彷徨。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\"></p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">如凋零带走记忆，如思念映照脸庞；</span></p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">如绝境吮舐希望，如黑暗点燃微光。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">少女得以省悟，死亡亦非终场。</span></p></div> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"skill\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--skill obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器技能</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">咏生谣曳</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">[能量消耗:0][冷却:15秒]发动一次斩击造成1000.0％攻击力的物理伤害。死生之律者装备时获得以下效果：伤害、冷却时间与能量消耗等属性由角色自身决定，全队角色自身在律者形态下离场时回复自身10.0点能量获取途径（触发间隔15.0秒，每个角色独立计时）</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">不凋绽蕾</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">全队角色物理伤害提高10.0％（该效果唯一生效），自身额外提高20.0％的物理伤害，律者形态下场上敌人受到来自自身的物理伤害提高20.0％。</span></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">生灭蔓缠</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">角色暴击率提高15.0％，死生之律者装备时，【塑灵形</span>态】下任意连携攻击命中敌人后，全队角色的必杀技命中【凋零之隙】下的敌人时会附带200.0％攻击力的<span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">物理伤害，持续18秒，该效果持续时间内仅生效一次等级</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 2;\"> <div data-part=\"forging\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--forging obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>悬赏锻造</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">超限素材</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"forging-material-td\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/2581/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\"><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2023/07/03/282941837/af78535d11aa2d173818f031fc4c4c22_6322379382549709378.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"obc-tmpl__icon\"><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">解锁「撷生之谣」图鉴后任意镰刀蛋池武器</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*1</span></div></div></td></tr> <tr><td class=\"h3\">其他素材</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"forging-other-material-td\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1274/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">爱因斯坦环磁机</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*100</span></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1140/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">超导金属氢</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*50</span></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1890/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">流体合金块</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*4</span></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 3;\"> <div data-part=\"material\" data-tmpl=\"stigmata\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-stigmata obc-tmpl__part--material obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>进化材料</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></